cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "eofigs: analysis-aware, publication-ready figures for Earth observation research"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-08"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24053760
abstract: >-
  eofigs turns Earth observation analysis outputs (rasters, time series and validation
  pairs) into journal-ready figures that know the analysis, the variable and the printed
  size. It provides journal presets with one-call export to vector PDF and 600 dpi raster
  files, a figure check (size, resolution, smallest font, font embedding, colour-blind
  safety), a variable library with fixed colour maps and units, print-size raster handling,
  Theil-Sen and Mann-Kendall trend statistics, and recipe figures for study area maps,
  trend maps with significance, event composites and accuracy scatters.
authors:
